    "description": "Hiptix is Roundabout's low-price ticket program for theatregoers ages 18\u201340. It's free to join, and gets you exclusive, advanced access to $30 tickets to all of Roundabout\u2019s Broadway and off-Broadway shows (2 tickets per production). Plus, your Hiptix membership comes with access to great parties.",
